# GitHub Profile Magic Repo - only track project files
# Ignore everything, then whitelist what we need

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!.github/
!.github/**
!data/

# Do not commit generated/cached assets (regenerated by workflow)
data/*.png
data/*.json
data/*.svg
scripts/__pycache__/

# Never track these
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pkl
*.db
*.sqlite
*.xlsx
*.pptx
*.zip
*.parquet
.kilo/
.venv/
venv/
.DS_Store
